## BLoC Creation

### File Structure
```
lib/presentation/bloc/{feature}/
├── {feature}_bloc.dart
├── {feature}_event.dart
├── {feature}_state.dart
└── {feature}.dart              # Barrel export
```

### Event Template

```dart
part of '{feature}_bloc.dart';

sealed class FeatureEvent {
  const FeatureEvent();
}

/// Load feature data
final class FeatureLoadRequested extends FeatureEvent {
  const FeatureLoadRequested();
}

/// Add new item
final class FeatureItemAdded extends FeatureEvent {
  final FeatureItem item;
  const FeatureItemAdded(this.item);
}

/// Delete item by ID
final class FeatureItemDeleted extends FeatureEvent {
  final String id;
  const FeatureItemDeleted(this.id);
}
```

### State Template

```dart
part of '{feature}_bloc.dart';

sealed class FeatureState {
  const FeatureState();
}

/// Initial state before any action
final class FeatureInitial extends FeatureState {
  const FeatureInitial();
}

/// Loading data
final class FeatureLoading extends FeatureState {
  const FeatureLoading();
}

/// Data loaded successfully
final class FeatureLoaded extends FeatureState {
  final List<FeatureItem> items;
  const FeatureLoaded(this.items);
}

/// Error occurred
final class FeatureError extends FeatureState {
  final String message;
  const FeatureError(this.message);
}
```

### BLoC Template

```dart
import 'package:bloc/bloc.dart';
import 'package:flutter_finance_assistant/domain/usecases/{feature}/{action}.dart';

part '{feature}_event.dart';
part '{feature}_state.dart';

class FeatureBloc extends Bloc<FeatureEvent, FeatureState> {
  final GetFeatureItems _getItems;
  final AddFeatureItem _addItem;

  FeatureBloc({
    required GetFeatureItems getItems,
    required AddFeatureItem addItem,
  })  : _getItems = getItems,
        _addItem = addItem,
        super(const FeatureInitial()) {
    on<FeatureLoadRequested>(_onLoadRequested);
    on<FeatureItemAdded>(_onItemAdded);
  }

  Future<void> _onLoadRequested(
    FeatureLoadRequested event,
    Emitter<FeatureState> emit,
  ) async {
    emit(const FeatureLoading());
    
    final result = await _getItems();
    
    result.fold(
      (failure) => emit(FeatureError(failure.message)),
      (items) => emit(FeatureLoaded(items)),
    );
  }

  Future<void> _onItemAdded(
    FeatureItemAdded event,
    Emitter<FeatureState> emit,
  ) async {
    final currentState = state;
    if (currentState is! FeatureLoaded) return;

    final result = await _addItem(event.item);
    
    result.fold(
      (failure) => emit(FeatureError(failure.message)),
      (_) {
        final updatedItems = [...currentState.items, event.item];
        emit(FeatureLoaded(updatedItems));
      },
    );
  }
}
```

### SyncBloc Example (Implemented)

The SyncBloc manages data synchronization between local Drift database and remote Firestore.

**Location**: `lib/presentation/bloc/sync/`

**Files**:
- `sync_bloc.dart` - Main BLoC with SyncManager and ConnectivityService
- `sync_event.dart` - 7 events with SyncStatus enum
- `sync_state.dart` - 6 states with SyncErrorType enum
- `sync_bloc_exports.dart` - Barrel export

**Events**:
```dart
// sync_event.dart
SyncInitialized()           // Initialize and start listening
SyncAllRequested()          // Full sync (push + pull)
SyncPushRequested()         // Push local changes only
SyncPullRequested()         // Pull remote changes only
SyncTableRequested(table)   // Sync specific table
SyncRetryFailedRequested()  // Retry failed sync items
SyncStateUpdated(status)    // Internal: handle state changes
SyncPendingCountRequested() // Get pending items count
```

**States**:
```dart
// sync_state.dart
SyncInitial()                                 // Before initialization
SyncOffline(pendingCount, lastSyncTime)       // Device offline
SyncInProgress(processedItems, totalItems)    // Sync in progress
SyncCompleted(syncedAt, itemsSynced)          // Success
SyncPartialSuccess(successCount, failedCount) // Partial success
SyncError(message, type, pendingCount)        // Error with type
```

**Dashboard Integration**:
```dart
// In DashboardScreen
late final SyncBloc _syncBloc;

@override
void initState() {
  super.initState();
  _syncBloc = sl<SyncBloc>();
  _syncBloc.add(const SyncInitialized());
}

// Sync button in app bar popup menu
PopupMenuItem<String>(
  value: 'sync',
  enabled: !isSyncing,
  child: Row(children: [
    Icon(isSyncing ? Icons.sync : Icons.cloud_sync),
    Text(isSyncing ? 'Syncing...' : 'Sync Now'),
  ]),
)
```

