## Entity Creation

### Location
`lib/domain/entities/{feature}.dart`

### Template

```dart
import 'package:equatable/equatable.dart';

/// Represents a {feature} in the domain layer.
/// 
/// This is a pure Dart class with no external dependencies.
class Feature extends Equatable {
  final String id;
  final String name;
  final double amount;
  final DateTime createdAt;

  const Feature({
    required this.id,
    required this.name,
    required this.amount,
    required this.createdAt,
  });

  /// Creates a copy with modified fields
  Feature copyWith({
    String? id,
    String? name,
    double? amount,
    DateTime? createdAt,
  }) {
    return Feature(
      id: id ?? this.id,
      name: name ?? this.name,
      amount: amount ?? this.amount,
      createdAt: createdAt ?? this.createdAt,
    );
  }

  @override
  List<Object?> get props => [id, name, amount, createdAt];
}
```

