## Drift Table Creation

### Location
`lib/data/datasources/local/tables/tables.dart`

### Template

```dart
/// Table for storing {feature}s
class Features extends Table {
  // Primary key
  TextColumn get id => text()();
  
  // Foreign key (if user-owned)
  TextColumn get userId => text().references(Users, #id)();
  
  // Feature-specific columns
  TextColumn get name => text().withLength(min: 1, max: 100)();
  RealColumn get amount => real()();
  
  // Timestamps (stored as Unix milliseconds)
  IntColumn get createdAt => integer()();
  IntColumn get updatedAt => integer()();
  
  // Sync status ('synced', 'pending', 'failed')
  TextColumn get syncStatus => text().withDefault(const Constant('pending'))();

  @override
  Set<Column> get primaryKey => {id};
}
```

### Column Types
```dart
TextColumn        // TEXT - for strings
IntColumn         // INTEGER - for ints, timestamps
RealColumn        // REAL - for doubles
BoolColumn        // INTEGER (0/1) - for booleans
DateTimeColumn    // INTEGER - auto-converts DateTime
BlobColumn        // BLOB - for binary data
```

### Column Modifiers
```dart
text()()                                    // Required
text().nullable()()                         // Optional
text().withDefault(const Constant(''))()    // With default
text().withLength(min: 1, max: 100)()       // Length constraint
text().references(OtherTable, #column)()    // Foreign key
integer().autoIncrement()()                 // Auto increment
```

